# CODEOWNERS: maintainer review for the Claude Code on the web bootstrap.
#
# .claude/settings.json registers .claude/hooks/session-start.sh as a SessionStart
# hook, so a web session runs the checked-out branch's copy of it, as root, before
# anyone has read the diff. That makes .claude/ a supply-chain surface in the same
# class as .github/workflows/: a change to it needs the maintainer's review, and
# web sessions should be opened only on branches you trust.
#
# Rules are last-match-wins. This file also owns itself, so the rule above cannot
# be removed without the same review.
